   "lines": [
    "Studies now fairly",
    "under way again.",
    "I think I shall",
    "do well in all",
    "except French 4, and",
    "very well in the",
    "Natural History",
    "courses.",
    "I am boxing with",
    "my \"Tutor\" five",
    "times a week; I am",
    "going to try hard",
    "for the light",
    "weight cups in",
    "boxing and",
    "wrestling."
